{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47662","headline":"秘诀歌 · 吕岩","name":"秘诀歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"求之不见，来即不见。\n不见不见，君之素面。\n火里曾飞，水中亦见。\n道路非遥，身心不恋。\n又不知有返阴之龟，回阳之鴈。\n遇即遇真人，达即达其神。\n一万二千甲子，这一壶流霞长春。\n流霞流霞，本性一家。\n饥餐日精，渴饮月华。\n将甲子丁丑之岁，与君决破东门之大瓜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吕岩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47662.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47662","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}